2026-10-20T07:11:06.8268553Z PASS repo with .git DIR contributes each convention subdir it has
2026-10-20T07:11:06.8272941Z PASS a git WORKTREE (.git file) counts as a repo
2026-10-20T07:11:06.8273974Z PASS a directory WITHOUT .git is not a repo
2026-10-20T07:11:06.8274472Z PASS a repo without any listed subdir contributes nothing
2026-10-20T07:11:06.8274994Z PASS an excluded child NAME is skipped even when it is a repo
2026-10-20T07:11:06.8275456Z PASS a missing parent is skipped silently
2026-10-20T07:11:06.8275860Z PASS discovered roots are articles, and marked
2026-10-20T07:11:06.8300760Z PASS explicit + discovered are unioned
2026-10-20T07:11:06.8303317Z PASS a path in both appears once, keeping the explicit entry
2026-10-20T07:11:06.8307863Z PASS exclude is handed to the builder
2026-10-20T07:11:06.8310358Z PASS skipNames extends the built-in set, never replaces it
2026-10-20T07:11:06.8334600Z PASS no discover block = no discovery
2026-10-20T07:11:06.8335674Z PASS an existing sources.json is NOT rewritten with a discover block
2026-10-20T07:11:06.8349650Z PASS a malformed discover block degrades to defaults, never throws
2026-10-20T07:11:06.8376099Z PASS a freshly seeded sources.json carries the discover block
2026-10-20T07:11:06.8377400Z PASS seeding does not invent roots outside the literal list + wikis
2026-10-20T07:11:06.8395281Z PASS a discovered root CONTAINING an explicit root is dropped (explicit wins)
2026-10-20T07:11:06.8396720Z PASS an unrelated discovered root is untouched by that drop
2026-10-20T07:11:06.8420282Z PASS a discovered root INSIDE an explicit root is dropped too
2026-10-20T07:11:06.8449187Z PASS between two discovered roots the ANCESTOR is kept and the descendant dropped
2026-10-20T07:11:06.8450950Z PASS a shared PREFIX is not containment (…/repoF/doc does not swallow …/repoF/docs)
2026-10-20T07:11:06.8904852Z PASS a REAL build with an explicit root nested in a discovered one does not throw
2026-10-20T07:11:06.8906133Z PASS each file is indexed exactly once
